OL,3,GNEWSACollege shut after gunmen fire
OL,4,Ashots at nearby home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA sixth form college has been closed
OL,7,Fafter gunmen fired shots at a nearby
OL,8,Fhouse.
OL,10,FSouth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,11,Fwere called to reports of a firearm
OL,12,Fbeing discharged outside a house in
OL,13,FHorninglow Road, in Sheffield, at about
OL,14,F04.42 BST, near to Longley Park Sixth
OL,15,FForm Academy.
OL,17,FThe force said it happened shortly
OL,18,Fafter a similar attack on a property in
OL,19,FSwanbourne Road. Nobody was hurt in
OL,20,Feither incident.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
