OL,3,GNEWSACollege shut after gunmen fire
OL,4,Ashots at nearby home
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement the college said while
OL,7,Fthe shooting in Horninglow Road was
OL,8,F"not in any way connected" the building
OL,9,Fwould be closed to staff and students.
